nd Powered by Russo&nbsp;Locations</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-494_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">15% off MSRP on select in-stock models on 10/11/24 only! Valid at ALL Russo Locations, Porters, and Haltom<strong><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/chainsaw-safety-ceu-seminar-tickets-984191522337?aff=eventcal" target="_self"></a></strong></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-496_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-497_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Engine Maintenance Seminar — Wisconsin&nbsp;— Oct 11, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-499_ pf-heading-1-h3">Russo: New Berlin, WI — 10:00AM - NOON</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-501_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/chainsaw-safety-ceu-seminar-tickets-848731959137?aff=eventcal" target="_blank"></a>Ensure the equipment you depend on is well taken care of by keeping the engine in prime condition. Learn about general engine maintenance, end-of-season storage &amp; winter maintenance, plus engine re-powers from Shields Bergstrom, a Customer Education Specialist with Briggs &amp; Stratton.&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/engine-maintenance-seminar-tickets-1038668073167?aff=eventcal" target="_self">Reserve Your Spot &gt;</a></strong></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-503_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-504_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Chainsaw Safety &amp; Maintenance CEU Seminar — Oct 4, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-506_ pf-heading-1-h3">Russo: Elgin, IL — 10:00AM CDT</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-508_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/chainsaw-safety-ceu-seminar-tickets-848731959137?aff=eventcal" target="_blank"></a>Earn <b>1.5 ISA CEUs</b> while learning about the best chainsaw safety practices from Andrew Guetler, a Gold Certified MasterWrench® Technician with Stihl. He will cover and discuss all the basics from chainsaw starting, usage, handling, maintenance, and more.&nbsp; <strong><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/chainsaw-safety-ceu-seminar-tickets-984191522337?aff=eventcal" target="_self">Reserve Your Spot &gt;</a></strong></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-510_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-511_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">Russo New Berlin Fall/Winter Open House&nbsp;— Sept 20, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-513_ pf-heading-1-h3">Russo: New Berlin, WI&nbsp;</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-515_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Join us in New Berlin, WI for our Fall/Winter Open House and Customer Appreciation Day&nbsp;on Friday, September 20!&nbsp;We’ll have free food, great deals, free seminar, cash raffles&nbsp;and more!&nbsp; <a href="/pages/fall-winter-open-house" target="_self"><strong>Learn More &gt;</strong></a></p></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-jwZJYP cIFzrt pf-517_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-518_ pf-heading-7-h3"><span style="color: rgb(190, 30, 45);">ITEA Trailer Safety Seminar — Sept 20, 2024</span></h3><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-bOhtQk gAzRSI pf-520_ pf-heading-1-h3">Russo: Frankfort, IL — 9:00AM CDT</h3><p class="sc-fbFjKN fqkBeE pf-522_ pf-text-2" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Driving with the wrong&nbsp;license class can land you some pretty hefty fines. Anybody who drives a municipal or contractor vehicle will greatly benefit from the information 